{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b8f0fc29-ebd4-8c21-9b49-73155f56f6c7",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T15:41:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dominic Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:38:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Dominic Ricci. I am calling about a sidewalk that has heaved up. I tripped on it yesterday morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:38:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. Are you all right? Did you get hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:39:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am all right. I caught myself on a fence post. But someone else could fall there and be hurt more seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:39:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Let me get some details. Where exactly is the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 31 Washington Street, in the Point. The slab in front of the house has lifted at the seam, perhaps two inches higher than the next one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:39:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 31 Washington Street, the slab lifted about two inches at the seam. Is it right at the edge of the street or further back toward the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at the street side. It is right in the bike lane, so cyclists also pass very close to it. A person who swerves around it will go into the traffic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:39:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So it's in the bike lane, which makes it more of a hazard. Do you know if the storm Friday and Saturday had anything to do with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I believe the storm made it worse. The water came through and the ground shifted. It was already rising slowly, but after the coastal storm, three days ago, it is much higher."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:40:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense, with the frost and the water getting under there. Let me write that down. And what time of day did you trip?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:40:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was about six-thirty in the morning, and still dark. I had been doing tai chi early on the back porch and then went out to the street to look at the weather."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:40:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, early morning, still dark, so hard to see it. I'll note that. What would you like us to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:40:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would like the street added to the repair list. I want it to be inspected and the slab to be corrected or ground down. Can you tell me that it will be added?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:40:36-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put in the request and have it logged for the inspection crew, and I'll note it as a trip hazard in a bike lane. I can't give you a date on the repair itself, since crews are backed up after the storm, but it will be on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:40:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Please read back to me what you have written."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:40:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Dominic Ricci, 31 Washington Street, the Point. Heaved sidewalk slab, about two inches, at the street side in the bike lane. You tripped on it yesterday morning, and you're asking for it to be added to the repair list. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:41:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. If you need to reach me, my number is 401-555-0196."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:41:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0196. Someone will follow up if they need more information."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:41:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That is all I need. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T15:41:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Ricci. Take care."
    }
  ],
